,{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4233},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.41100000000000003},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39759999999999995},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3918}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-10-after-sambhaji-reel1-madhavrao.md","words":239,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"After Maratha defeat at Panipat, an"},{"sec":2,"text":"empire was left in the hands of"},{"sec":3.6,"text":"16-year-old. His name was Madhavrao. The"},{"sec":6,"text":"Maratha leadership had been decimated."},{"sec":8.2,"text":"The heir to Peshwa throne was dead. The"},{"sec":10.2,"text":"empire was drowning in debt. The Nizam"},{"sec":12.4,"text":"of Hyderabad saw his chance. He"},{"sec":14.3,"text":"mobilized 60,000 [music]"},{"sec":15.6,"text":"troops and marched into Maratha"},{"sec":17.1,"text":"territory, backed by disgruntled Maratha"},{"sec":19.5,"text":"sardars who had joined his side. Soon"},{"sec":21.7,"text":"his army was closing in on Pune. Panic"},{"sec":23.9,"text":"spread through the capital. Madhavrao"},{"sec":25.8,"text":"had to order its evacuation. The Nizam"},{"sec":28.2,"text":"made a fatal mistake. On his march"},{"sec":30.2,"text":"towards Pune, his forces desecrated the"},{"sec":32.6,"text":"sacred temples at Toka and Sangam. The"},{"sec":35.2,"text":"act outraged Maratha chiefs serving in"},{"sec":37.3,"text":"his own camp. Madhavrao seized the"},{"sec":39.2,"text":"opening. He sent emissaries across enemy"},{"sec":41.3,"text":"[music] lines, using the sacrilege to"},{"sec":43.1,"text":"persuade sardars to abandon the Nizam."},{"sec":45.2,"text":"It worked. Powerful commanders,"},{"sec":47,"text":"including Ramchandra Jadhav, returned to"},{"sec":48.8,"text":"the Peshwa's side. The Nizam's invasion"},{"sec":51.2,"text":"unraveled. Deep in Maratha territory,"},{"sec":53.3,"text":"cut off and starved by relentless"},{"sec":55.1,"text":"guerrilla attacks, Nizam was forced to"},{"sec":57.3,"text":"negotiate. But the victory came with a"},{"sec":59.2,"text":"twist. Maratha sardars wanted Nizam Ali"},{"sec":61.5,"text":"finished off for good. Yet [music]"},{"sec":63.1,"text":"Raghunathrao, still serving as a regent,"},{"sec":65.4,"text":"agreed to a generous settlement. But"},{"sec":67.5,"text":"why? Madhavrao had proved he was no"},{"sec":69.8,"text":"puppet. His uncle saw him as a rival and"},{"sec":72.4,"text":"Nizam [music] as a useful ally. The"},{"sec":74,"text":"young Peshwa had survived one threat to"},{"sec":75.8,"text":"his empire. The next would come from"},{"sec":77.8,"text":"within his own family."}],"text":""}}